#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.rst:2
msgid "bollinger\\_band"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:1
msgid "Compute Bollinger Bands for a tensor."
msgstr "テンソルに対するボリンジャーバンドを計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:3
msgid ""
"Bollinger Bands are a technical analysis tool consisting of a middle band"
" (moving average) and two outer bands (upper and lower). The outer bands "
"are placed at a distance of :attr:`sigma` standard deviations from the "
"middle band. This indicator is commonly used in financial analysis to "
"identify potential support and resistance levels."
msgstr ""
"ボリンジャーバンドは、テクニカル分析ツールの一種で、中心バンド（移動平均線）と上下2本のバンドで構成されます。上下バンドは、中心バンドから "
":attr:`sigma` "
"標準偏差の距離に配置されます。この指標は金融分析において一般的に使用され、潜在的なサポートレベルやレジスタンスレベルを識別するために用いられます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:10
msgid "The input tensor containing time series data."
msgstr "時系列データを含む入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:13
msgid ""
"The size of the moving window for calculating the moving average and "
"standard deviation. Default is 20."
msgstr "移動平均と標準偏差を算出するための移動ウィンドウのサイズ。デフォルト値は20です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:18
msgid ""
"The number of standard deviations for the upper and lower bands. Default "
"is 2.0."
msgstr "上バンドと下バンドの標準偏差の数。デフォルト値は2.0です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:22
msgid ""
"The dimension along which to compute the Bollinger Bands. Default is -1 "
"(the last dimension)."
msgstr "ボリンジャーバンドを計算する次元。デフォルトは-1（最後の次元）です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:26
msgid ""
"A tuple containing three tensors of the same shape as the input:  - Upper"
" band: middle band + (sigma * standard deviation) - Middle band: moving "
"average - Lower band: middle band - (sigma * standard deviation)"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:26
msgid "A tuple containing three tensors of the same shape as the input:"
msgstr "入力と同じ形状の3つのテンソルを含むタプル:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:28
msgid "Upper band: middle band + (sigma * standard deviation)"
msgstr "上バンド: 中バンド + (シグマ * 標準偏差)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:29
msgid "Middle band: moving average"
msgstr "中央バンド: 移動平均線"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:30
msgid "Lower band: middle band - (sigma * standard deviation)"
msgstr "下バンド: 中バンド - (シグマ * 標準偏差)"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:34
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:36
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([[100., 102., 101., 103., 105.],\n"
"...                   [50., 48., 49., 51., 52.]])\n"
">>> upper, middle, lower = QF.bollinger_band(x, window=3, sigma=1.0, "
"dim=1)\n"
">>> upper\n"
"tensor([[     nan,      nan, 101.8165, 102.8165, 104.6330],\n"
"        [     nan,      nan,  49.8165,  50.5805,  51.9139]])\n"
">>> middle\n"
"tensor([[     nan,      nan, 101.0000, 102.0000, 103.0000],\n"
"        [     nan,      nan,  49.0000,  49.3333,  50.6667]])\n"
">>> lower\n"
"tensor([[     nan,      nan, 100.1835, 101.1835, 101.3670],\n"
"        [     nan,      nan,  48.1835,  48.0861,  49.4195]])"
msgstr ">>> x = torch.tensor([[100., 102., 101., 103., 105.],\n...                   [50., 48., 49., 51., 52.]])\n>>> upper, middle, lower = QF.bollinger_band(x, window=3, sigma=1.0, dim=1)\n>>> upper\ntensor([[     nan,      nan, 101.8165, 102.8165, 104.6330],\n        [     nan,      nan,  49.8165,  50.5805,  51.9139]])\n>>> middle\ntensor([[     nan,      nan, 101.0000, 102.0000, 103.0000],\n        [     nan,      nan,  49.0000,  49.3333,  50.6667]])\n>>> lower\ntensor([[     nan,      nan, 100.1835, 101.1835, 101.3670],\n        [     nan,      nan,  48.1835,  48.0861,  49.4195]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:49
msgid ":func:`ma`: Moving average function used for the middle band."
msgstr ":func:`ma`: ミドルバンドに使用される移動平均関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.bollinger_band.bollinger_band:50
msgid ":func:`mstd`: Moving standard deviation function used for the band width."
msgstr ":func:`mstd`: バンド幅の計算に使用される移動標準偏差関数。"

